{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":27610,"name":"xjd","username":"xjd","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/talk.nervos.org/xjd/{size}/3935_2.png","created_at":"2026-11-20T00:55:32.961Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003ePort c-kzg-4844 to CKB-VM; see \u003ca href=\"https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-4844\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eEIP-4844\u003c/a\u003e for more details.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe also introduce a \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/XuJiandong/c-kzg-4844/blob/port-riscv/blob-tree/tutorial/README.md\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eblob tree\u003c/a\u003e built on c-kzg-4844. We already have SMT, but SMT proofs are quite large, especially when proving multiple elements at once. So we propose a new solution: the blob tree. At its core, it is a two-level path tree built on c-kzg-4844 with Shplonk. It commits to as many as 16,777,216 (4096×4096) elements in a tree of just two levels. Whether you query one element or many, the proof reduces to a single KZG verification call.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003caside class=\"onebox githubfolder\" data-onebox-src=\"https://github.com/XuJiandong/c-kzg-4844/tree/port-riscv\"\u003e\n  \u003cheader class=\"source\"\u003e\n      \u003cimg src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/b/bad3e5f9ad67c1ddf145107ce7032ac1d7b22563.svg\" class=\"site-icon\" alt=\"\" data-dominant-color=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"\u003e\n\n      \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/XuJiandong/c-kzg-4844/tree/port-riscv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003egithub.com\u003c/a\u003e\n  \u003c/header\u003e\n\n  \u003carticle class=\"onebox-body\"\u003e\n    \u003ch3\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://github.com/XuJiandong/c-kzg-4844/tree/port-riscv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eGitHub - XuJiandong/c-kzg-4844: A minimal implementation of the Polynomial...\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\n  \u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://github.com/XuJiandong/c-kzg-4844/tree/port-riscv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eport-riscv\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n  \u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"label1\"\u003eA minimal implementation of the Polynomial Commitments API for EIP-4844 and EIP-7594, written in C. - XuJiandong/c-kzg-4844\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n  \u003c/article\u003e\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"onebox-metadata\"\u003e\n    \n    \n  \u003c/div\u003e\n\n  \u003cdiv style=\"clear: both\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/aside\u003e\n","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":1,"updated_at":"2026-11-20T00:55:32.961Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":4,"reads":17,"readers_count":16,"score":83.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":11273,"topic_slug":"c-kzg-4844-on-ckb-vm-blob-tree","display_username":"xjd","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-4844","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"EIP-4844: Shard Blob Transactions","clicks":1},{"url":"https://github.com/XuJiandong/c-kzg-4844/blob/port-riscv/blob-tree/tutorial/README.md","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"c-kzg-4844/blob-tree/tutorial/README.md at port-riscv · XuJiandong/c-kzg-4844 · GitHub","clicks":1},{"url":"https://github.com/XuJiandong/c-kzg-4844/tree/port-riscv","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"GitHub - XuJiandong/c-kzg-4844: A minimal implementation of the Polynomial Commitments API for EIP-4844 and EIP-7594, written in C. · GitHub","clicks":1}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":2}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":1934,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/c-kzg-4844-on-ckb-vm-